  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qx1z](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qx1z) Magnitude 6.1 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Sep 18 2025 28km S of Nabire. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -3.6145 longitude 135.5258. It impacted 91563 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
